&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Analytics organisation sits at the heart of Deliveroo powering decision-making across our 3 sided marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Analytics Engineering Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our London team. This is a hybrid role, with 3 days per week on-site. In this role, you’ll lead a team of Analytics Engineers embedded in a key business domain, owning the pipelines, models and metrics that power day-to-day decisions and building the data foundations your stakeholders rely on.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Analytics Engineering Org&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Analytics Engineering is a core pillar of Deliveroo’s Analytics organisation, alongside Data Science. With over 70 Analytics Engineers across the UK and India, we are embedded directly within product and business domains, owning the pipelines, models and metrics that power decision-making at scale: from self-serve AI-enabled analytics and experimentation through to executive reporting and strategic planning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The discipline is evolving fast. With new tooling changing how we work, we are shifting from building data pipelines to building AI first data products, developing rich semantic and data context layers and empowering self-serve data users. This role leads that work across a defined business domain, directly managing a team of Analytics Engineers and helping shape AE standards, culture and direction across the wider org.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Directly lead a team of Analytics Engineers embedded in a defined business domain, owning their performance, development and wellbeing&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Own the AE roadmap for your domain, identifying the highest-leverage investments, prioritising competing requests, and building the case for them with your business and product stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drive a data products mindset across your estate: clear ownership, SLAs, observability and data contracts built into how your team works by default&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Maintain strong technical involvement: reviewing data models and SQL, guiding architectural decisions, and stepping in hands-on when your team needs unblocking&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Contribute to AE-wide decisions on tooling, standards and process, helping shape how Analytics Engineering works at Deliveroo beyond your immediate team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a high-performing, inclusive team culture by giving regular and actionable feedback, handling performance and motivation challenges, and running effective rituals&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Partner with Recruiting to hire strong, diverse AE talent into your team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience in an Analytics Engineering, BI Engineering, or Data Engineering role, with strong, hands-on SQL foundations you still draw on regularly&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Proven experience managing a team of ICs, with a track record of developing people, giving hard feedback, and handling typical team situations independently&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to own a technical roadmap for a domain area and deliver against it with measurable business impact&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Strong grounding across the modern AE stack (cloud data warehousing, transformation tooling, data modelling, and data quality practices), with the ability to engage credibly on technical decisions and unblock your team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Comfortable engaging and influencing at senior business and product level, with experience aligning analytics investment to domain priorities&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience in a marketplace, e-commerce, grocery or retail analytics context&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with semantic and metrics layer tooling, or Python for data automation and pipeline work&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Exposure to AI for Data, including agentic AI methods, semantic layers, or AI-assisted analytics workflows&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience contributing to analytics ways of working: documentation standards, peer review processes, onboarding, and knowledge sharing&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔧 Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;br&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;🌱&lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;br&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership&lt;br&gt; environment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;🧠Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;br&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌎A culture built for builders&lt;br&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;​​&lt;strong&gt;💰 Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
