&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;It’s an exciting time to join our rapidly growing Accounting team with ample development opportunities. We&#39;re growing the Revenue Data team with Engineering and Accounting Data openings to drive our automation and systems infrastructure and while keeping pace within one of the fastest growing marketplace companies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Senior Engineer for Accounting Infrastructure and Systems designs, builds, and maintains the scalable backend services, data pipelines, and integrations that power DoorDash&#39;s accounting, reconciliation, and financial reporting workflows. Working closely with Finance, Accounting, and fellow engineers, this role translates complex financial and regulatory requirements into reliable, automated systems that ensure accuracy, auditability, and compliance at scale. The ideal candidate brings strong distributed-systems and data engineering expertise along with a solid understanding of financial processes, and takes technical ownership of critical projects while mentoring junior engineers and helping shape the team&#39;s architecture and best practices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take technical ownership of critical accounting infrastructure projects — designing and building the backend services, data pipelines, and integrations that power DoorDash&#39;s financial reporting, reconciliation, and close workflows at scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Partner directly with Finance and Accounting stakeholders to translate complex financial and regulatory requirements into reliable, auditable, and automated systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shape the team&#39;s architecture and engineering best practices, mentoring junior engineers and raising the technical bar across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drive measurable improvements in data accuracy, pipeline reliability, and system performance in a high-impact, compliance-critical environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You have 5+ years of experience in software or data engineering, with a strong track record of owning and delivering complex backend or data infrastructure projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You have deep expertise in distributed systems and data engineering, with hands-on experience in tools like Snowflake, dbt, Fivetran, or similar modern data stack technologies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can navigate the intersection of engineering and finance — understanding concepts like revenue recognition, reconciliation, and auditability well enough to build systems that meet those requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You have a collaborative, low-ego approach and can effectively partner with both technical and non-technical stakeholders across Finance, Accounting, and Engineering.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with SOX controls, data quality frameworks, or financial systems (e.g., NetSuite) is a strong plus.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At DoorDash, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a massive marketplace that’s constantly evolving. By joining our London-based team on a Deliveroo contract, you get the unique advantage of working within a vibrant local business environment while directly blueprinting global-scale processes for the broader DoorDash Inc. group.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re problem solvers, community builders, and innovators, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day:&lt;/strong&gt; Your work directly improves experiences for merchants, consumers, partners, and dashers/riders worldwide by building clean, frictionless operational workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Work close to the market with autonomy, pace, and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role:&lt;/strong&gt; Stretch yourself, develop new skills, and grow as the global business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;DoorDash brings together brands and teams with massive reach, scale, and ambition. In this role, you &lt;strong&gt;will&lt;/strong&gt; collaborate directly with teammates, systems, and leaders across our entire global footprint, including Deliveroo, Wolt, and DoorDash US. Together, we are unlocking new possibilities and driving global impact as one unified team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;We know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;#LI-ID1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
